@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName sans-serif
skinparam roundCorner 10

title EduCore — Super Admin Administrative Workflows

actor "Super Admin" as Admin
participant "Vue 3 SPA\n(Inertia.js)" as UI
participant "Super Admin Controller\n& Policies" as Backend
database "PostgreSQL DB" as DB
database "Redis & Logs" as Logs

== Dashboard & Navigation ==
Admin -> UI : Sign in with credentials & TOTP
UI -> Backend : Authenticate session
Backend --> UI : Return role 'super-admin'
UI -> UI : Redirect to /admin/dashboard
UI -> Backend : GET /admin/dashboard
Backend -> DB : Query system metrics (users, active terms, errors)
Backend --> UI : Render admin dashboard cards

== User Provisioning & 2FA Emergency Reset ==
Admin -> UI : Navigate to /users & click 'New User'
Admin -> UI : Submit form (Name, Email, Role, Department)
UI -> Backend : POST /users
Backend -> Backend : Validate email uniqueness & password policy
Backend -> DB : Insert user & assign role in model_has_roles
Backend -> Logs : Record Audit Event (users.created)
Backend --> UI : Return success toast

alt Emergency Two-Factor Reset
  Admin -> UI : Click 'Reset Two-Factor' on locked user
  UI -> Backend : DELETE /users/{id}/two-factor
  Backend -> DB : Nullify two_factor_secret, recovery codes, confirmed_at
  Backend -> Logs : Record Audit Event (users.2fa_reset)
  Backend --> UI : Confirm 2FA reset toast
end

== Academic Structure & Global System Audit ==
Admin -> UI : Navigate to /academic-years
Admin -> UI : Create Academic Year & Semesters
UI -> Backend : POST /academic-years
Backend -> DB : Persist Academic Year & Semesters
Backend --> UI : Render updated academic calendar

Admin -> UI : Navigate to /audit-logs
UI -> Backend : GET /audit-logs (with filter query params)
Backend -> DB : Fetch paginated audit trail
Backend --> UI : Display audit logs with diff viewer & CSV export

@enduml
